  "final_message": "Renewal invoices were billing metered prices at quantity 0 because of a unit mismatch in `records_in_period` in `billing/usage.py`. I fixed it, and the 24 tests pass. I didn't add a regression test for this case.\n\nUsage records store their timestamp in milliseconds (`to_millis`). Billing periods are in seconds. The function compared the two directly, so no record ever fell inside the period. `aggregate_usage` then returned 0.\n\nThe fix converts `period_start` and `period_end` to milliseconds before the comparison.\n\nI also wrote `answer.json` in the repository root:\n```json\n{\"file\": \"usage.py\", \"function\": \"records_in_period\"}\n```",
